  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 11 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nSet on one of Millwater’s best streets, this home sits on a generous 702sqm landscaped site, making the most of its elevated position and beautiful sea and estuary views.\r\n\r\nWith approximately 327sqm of floor area, there is plenty of room for the whole family. Across two levels are five bedrooms, three bathrooms plus a separate WC, three living areas and multiple outdoor spaces, offering plenty of flexibility for family living.\r\n\r\nThe main living area is the hub of the home, with the kitchen, dining and family room opening directly to the decks and landscaped garden.\r\n\r\nThe elevated position captures wide views towards the sea and Orewa Estuary, while the established landscaping provides privacy and shelter.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the master bedroom is a real highlight, with corner windows offering stunning sea and estuary views and a beautiful outlook to wake up to. The master also has its own ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, with three further bedrooms, a family bathroom and a separate living area completing the upper level. Downstairs, the guest master has its own ensuite, ideal for teenagers, guests, extended family or anyone wanting their own space.\r\n\r\nOutside, the established, well-maintained landscaped garden complements the home and provides an inviting outdoor setting.\r\n\r\nLocated on one of Millwater’s most sought-after streets, the home is within easy walking distance of local schools and cafés, with parks, walkways and other Millwater amenities close by.\r\n\r\nThe highlights:\r\n• Elevated position with sea & Orewa Estuary views\r\n• 702sqm landscaped section, and approx. 327sqm floor area\r\n• 5 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms including 2 ensuites\r\n• Two generous living areas downstairs and one separate lounge upstairs\r\n• Open-plan kitchen, dining and family living\r\n• Multiple decks and outdoor living areas. Established landscaped garden\r\n\r\nOur vendors are ready to move on. Their instructions are clear: this property must be sold.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing or join our next open home.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
